  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 420532,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/DeadMoon0/TestFramework-UI",
  "published": "1900-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First release. Steps take a RunContext, so a wait reads its own deadline instead of guessing a margin before it. Failure evidence - screenshot, markup, session story, and the held-open browser - moves out of the steps into a step observer the engine drives. The page now hands its answers over as text, parsed with Newtonsoft like the rest of the family. Requires TestFramework.Core 0.4.0 and TestFramework.Config 0.3.0. Bridge a differently-named application with BridgedTo, naming the kind the serving package defines.",
